.TH DICTATE 1 "" "dictate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dictate \- dictation into the focused input on GNOME on Wayland
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dictate
.RI [ LANG | status | cancel ]
.br
.B dictate setup
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The first press records, the second transcribes and inserts the text into the
input that had focus at the first. Bound to one shortcut per language by
.BR "dictate setup" ,
which also sets the input source and writes
.IR ~/.config/dictate/config .
Run
.B dictate setup \-\-help
for its options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dictate/config
Settings, as KEY="value" lines. A DICTATE_ variable in the environment wins.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/dictate/state
The current phase, read by the tray icon and
.BR dictate-status (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dictate-status (1),
.BR dictate-indicator (1)
